{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/wishlist.png?t=1744251151\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Fringe</strong> is a grim hardcore tactical RPG set in a biopunk wasteland. Explore a hand-crafted pixel nightmare that blends the nostalgic charm of classic strategy games with tactical freedom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/The_Terrain_is_your_domain.png?t=1744251151\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate and transform spaces; modify, destroy, or replace grid elements to exploit terrain height and effects, gaining tactical advantages by strategically positioning your squad.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/grid_EN.gif?t=1744251151\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/Biopunk_Nightmare_EN.png?t=1744251151\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Confront unimaginable foes: toxic tumors, spores, larva swarms, and bio-technologically modified enemies await. Explore this grim, low-fantasy world, challenging fearsome creatures or dangerous mercenaries. Wage war against rival factions and obliterate your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/Fighting_Monsters_w_Border_EN.gif?t=1744251151\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/Deep_Character_Modifications.png?t=1744251151\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine unique character compositions with devastating firepower, and upgrade their arsenal to get the most out of their abilities and dominate each encounter. Strategically, add powerful item upgrades and track your stats before entering the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/preparation_EN.gif?t=1744251151\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/Titanic_Domination_Boss.png?t=1744251151\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle ultra-large units that control multiple grids, capable of unleashing devastating attacks and altering the flow of battle.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/boss.gif?t=1744251151\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/Edit_Levels_Create_Legends.png?t=1744251151\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Employ the built-in graphical editor to easily create your own levels, characters, and campaigns, with ALL GAME ASSETS AVAILABLE! Share your creations with players worldwide through the workshop and experience limitless adventures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/editor.gif?t=1744251151\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/Uncover_The_Story_Truth.png?t=1744251151\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into dangerous endless territories, uncovering the secrets of the apocalypse that changed the world forever and the histories of rival factions with each expedition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/mission_EN.gif?t=1744251151\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/Forge_your_story.png?t=1744251151\" />Encounter a variety of characters and factions. Form alliances or incite rivalries, making strategic choices that forge your path and shape your story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/choice_EN.gif?t=1744251151\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3067920?t=1744251151","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744251151","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744251151","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744251151","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Violence, partial nudity"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3073010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/discord-join-community.png?t=1744251151\" /></p></p><br><h1