 upgrade their arsenal to get the most out of their abilities and dominate each encounter. Strategically, add powerful item upgrades and track your stats before entering the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/preparation_EN.gif?t=1744251151\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/Titanic_Domination_Boss.png?t=1744251151\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle ultra-large units that control multiple grids, capable of unleashing devastating attacks and altering the flow of battle.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/boss.gif?t=1744251151\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/Edit_Levels_Create_Legends.png?t=1744251151\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Employ the built-in graphical editor to easily create your own levels, characters, and campaigns, with ALL GAME ASSETS AVAILABLE! Share your creations with players worldwide through the workshop and experience limitless adventures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/editor.gif?t=1744251151\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/Uncover_The_Story_Truth.png?t=1744251151\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into dangerous endless territories, uncovering the secrets of the apocalypse that changed the world forever and the histories of rival factions with each expedition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it